babydsp reconstructs libasound_module_pcm_babydsp.so, the ALSA plugin that
Logitech shipped as a binary in SqueezeOS 7.x for the Squeezebox Radio
(package squeezeos-dsp-bin, marked LICENSE = "Confidential"). The filter
structure and coefficients were taken from that binary.

